# Allowlist: everything is ignored except what the negations below re-admit.
# vsce keeps a file if it matches any `!` pattern, so the ignore lines are not re-applied to
# re-admitted files — hence dist/*.js + dist/*.css rather than dist/** to keep source maps out.
**
!dist/*.js
!dist/*.css
!bin/**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
